# MiClash intended routing contract v1
ip route replace local default dev lo table 100
ip rule add pref 1000 fwmark 0x1 table 100
ip route replace default dev clash-tun table 101
ip rule add pref 1001 fwmark 0x3 table 101
ip -6 route replace local default dev lo table 100
ip -6 rule add pref 1000 fwmark 0x1 table 100
ip -6 route replace default dev clash-tun table 101
ip -6 rule add pref 1001 fwmark 0x3 table 101
